# The pause menu's first tab, "Mario" (w/<language>/win.tpl image 1), as Bowser's while he's the player
# (Play as Bowser, docs/PLAY_AS.md): the game's own tab with its lettering taken off, and "Bowser" put on
# it letter by letter from the game's own lettering on its other tabs and buttons, recoloured to the
# "Mario" tab's pale pink with its dark red line, as luigi_tabs.recipe does Luigi's. Loaded under
# Dolphin's name for the tab it replaces, in the "*#bowser" texture set (luigi_faces_aurora.c).
# Six letters where Mario has five: each a little narrower than its source.
# (No Japanese version: the disc's lettering has no ク or パ; Mario's tab shows there.)

image art/icons/bowser/ui/tex1_96x40_b3df1434fe52ff08_14.png
  discs G8ME01 G8MP01
  load tpl w/us/win.tpl 1
  # the clean board (luigi_tabs.recipe's)
  mask frame rect 5 4 13 32
  mask frame + rect 87 4 91 32
  fill in frame #aa1900
  mask panel rect 15 5 85 31
  fill in panel #ce5542
  mask ledge rect 14 6 14 31
  fill in ledge #c0422c
  mask redge rect 86 6 86 31
  fill in redge #c0402c
  # B: "Badges"'s (image 4, the green tab)
  piece B tpl w/us/win.tpl 4
  @B crop 2 6 20 24
  @B alpha set 0 where h=70..110 s>=0.45 v>=0.5
  @B map #d6e3ce -> #e6ccd3 #99cd52 -> #d05741 #6ba818 -> #a91a00 #426110 -> #420c00
  @B scale 17 22 texel
  # o and r: "Mario"'s own
  piece o tpl w/us/win.tpl 1
  @o crop 73 12 19 20
  @o alpha set 0 where h=0..20 s>=0.45 v>=0.5
  @o alpha set 0 where h=350..360 s>=0.45 v>=0.5
  @o scale 16 18 texel
  piece r tpl w/us/win.tpl 1
  @r crop 48 13 17 19
  @r alpha set 0 where h=0..20 s>=0.45 v>=0.5
  @r alpha set 0 where h=350..360 s>=0.45 v>=0.5
  @r scale 14 18 texel
  # w: "Number"'s m (image 173, a purple button), turned over
  piece w tpl w/us/win.tpl 173
  @w crop 37 11 19 18
  @w alpha set 0 where h=230..265 s>=0.25 v>=0.32
  @w map #d6d7e7 -> #e6ccd3 #5a4e99 -> #d05741 #1c1838 -> #420c00
  @w flip y
  @w scale 16 17 texel
  # s: "Badges"'s
  piece s tpl w/us/win.tpl 4
  @s crop 76 12 14 18
  @s alpha set 0 where h=70..110 s>=0.45 v>=0.5
  @s map #d6e3ce -> #e6ccd3 #99cd52 -> #d05741 #6ba818 -> #a91a00 #426110 -> #420c00
  @s scale 12 17 texel
  # e: "Number"'s
  piece e tpl w/us/win.tpl 173
  @e crop 67 11 16 18
  @e alpha set 0 where h=230..265 s>=0.25 v>=0.32
  @e map #d6d7e7 -> #e6ccd3 #5a4e99 -> #d05741 #1c1838 -> #420c00
  @e scale 14 17 texel
  # on the baseline of "Mario" (row 30)
  paste B 6 9
  paste o 22 13
  paste w 36 14
  paste s 51 14
  paste e 62 14
  paste r 75 13
end
